Output docs/demo/kajota-zama-terminal.gif

Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1200
Set Height 900
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set TypingSpeed 35ms

Hide
Type "cd ~/Documents/kajota-zama && setopt interactivecomments && clear" Enter
Show
Sleep 600ms

Type "# KaJota Confidential Pay :: FHEVM confidential-payment contract" Enter
Sleep 800ms
Type "npm test" Enter
Sleep 8s

Type "# 8/8 green: encrypted transfer, overspend-clamp no-leak, owner-only ACL" Enter
Sleep 1500ms
Type "# and it is live on Sepolia with four real confidential transactions:" Enter
Sleep 700ms
Type "node scripts/show-proofs.mjs" Enter
Sleep 5s
